- A chart that takes a wire: numbers in, a line out.
-
- The chart of mol takes a list of GRAPH OBJECTS, which is the right interface for
- a chart and the wrong end of a wire: a wire carries a value, and nobody is going
- to build a graph object in a code cell to feed one. So the port here is a list of
- numbers and the graph is made from it inside.
$bog_vmap_part_plot $mol_view
	- The port a wire lands on.
	values /number
	title \
	color \
	sub /
		<= Title $mol_view
			sub / <= title
		<= Chart $mol_chart
			graphs /$mol_plot_graph
				<= Line $mol_plot_line
					series_x <= series_x /number
					series_y <= values
					color <= color
					title <= title
